格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"一个 dsh-better-sidebar 的消费插件：在侧边栏新增一个「文件」tab，内置一棵固定在工作区（cwd）内的文件树，提供真正的文件管理能力——上传、移动、删除、重命名、新建文件夹。它补充了 better-sidebar 自带 Explorer 缺失的「写」操作（Explorer 只读）","id":"gh:1338287704","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-sidebar-Explorer-Plus","slug":"Wulabalabo/dsh-sidebar-Explorer-Plus","topics":["dsh","dsh-better-sidebar","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugin-market","dsh-plugins"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"一个 dsh-better-sidebar 的消费插件：在侧边栏新增一个「文件」tab，内置一棵固定在工作区（cwd）内的文件树，提供真正的文件管理能力——上传、移动、删除、重命名、新建文件夹。它补充"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"了 better-sidebar 自带 Explorer 缺失的「写」操作（Explorer 只读）"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-sidebar-explorer-plus"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**A TypeScript / React file manager for the DeepSeek Harness sidebar.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English · 中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## English"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Adds a **Files** tab to `dsh-better-sidebar` through its public `ctx.betterSidebar.registerTab` serv"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"ice. The plugin combines a React file tree with host-side file operations, without modifying the sid"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"combines a React file tree with host-side file operations, without modifying the sidebar foundation."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"### Features"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- Drag and drop files or folders to upload, preserving folder structure.\n- Move, rename, delete, and"},{"id":"p8s2","text":" create directories from the file tree.\n- Open files in the sidebar editor.\n- Reject existing destin"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"ations when moving or renaming. Uploads can replace existing files; deletion is permanent and asks f"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"or confirmation in the UI.\n- Host/origin request checks, upload-size limits, and working-directory p"},{"id":"p8s5","text":"ath checks in the host API."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"### Install"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Requires a running DSH web profile, `dsh-better-sidebar` (peer dependency `>=0.4.0`), and Node.js 20"},{"id":"p10s2","text":" running DSH web profile, `dsh-better-sidebar` (peer dependency `>=0.4.0`), and Node.js 20 or newer."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Restart `dsh web`, then hard-refresh the browser. Open the sidebar **+** menu and select **Files / 文"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"件**. The repository includes built files in `lib/`, so Git-based installation does not require a loc"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"repository includes built files in `lib/`, so Git-based installation does not require a local build."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### Code and API map"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| Part | Responsibility |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| `src/index.ts` | Host routes, request checks, upload limits, file operations, and structured error"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"s. |\n| `src/client/index.tsx` | React file tree, drag and drop, context menus, and tab registration."},{"id":"p15s3","text":" |\n| `build.mjs` | Host/client bundling; the build script also generates TypeScript declarations. |\n"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"| `cordis.patch.yml` | Plugin mounting configuration. |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"All operations use `POST /sidebar-explorer/<operation>`:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| Operation | Payload |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| `upload` | Query: `sessionId`, `name`, optional `dir` and `cwd`; raw bytes in the body. |\n| `delet"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"e` / `mkdir` | JSON: `sessionId`, absolute `path`, optional `cwd`. |\n| `move` | JSON: `sessionId`, a"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"bsolute `from` and `to`, optional `cwd`. |\n| `rename` | JSON: `sessionId`, absolute `path`, new `nam"},{"id":"p18s4","text":"e`, optional `cwd`. |"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Successful operations return `{ ok: true, value }`. Operation errors return `{ ok: false, error: { c"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"ode, message } }`; rejected trust checks and unsupported HTTP methods return plain HTTP 403/405 resp"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"essage } }`; rejected trust checks and unsupported HTTP methods return plain HTTP 403/405 responses."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"### Development"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"The default upload limit is **50 MiB per file**. Set `uploadLimit` in the profile config to change t"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"he byte limit; see the configuration example below."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"### Troubleshooting and operating scope"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"- **Tab missing:** confirm the sidebar dependency is installed, restart the host, and hard-refresh t"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"he browser.\n- **HTTP 403:** check the configured trusted host and the browser origin.\n- **HTTP 409 o"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"n move/rename:** choose a destination that does not already exist.\n- **Upload too large:** reduce th"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"e file size or adjust `uploadLimit`."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"The current path checks compare path strings; they do not resolve symlinks or fully canonicalize tra"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"versal segments in every operation. Working-directory selection also has client/process fallbacks. R"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"un this in a trusted workspace; these checks do not establish isolation for untrusted filesystem con"},{"id":"p25s4","text":"sted workspace; these checks do not establish isolation for untrusted filesystem content or callers."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## 中文"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"一个 `dsh-better-sidebar` 的**消费插件**：在侧边栏新增一个「文件」tab，内置一棵**固定在工作区（cwd）内的文件树**，提供真正的文件管理能力——上传、移动、删除、重命名"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"、新建文件夹。它补充了 better-sidebar 自带 Explorer 缺失的「写」操作（Explorer 只读）。"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"它通过 `dsh-better-sidebar` 公开的 `ctx.betterSidebar.registerTab` 服务注册，是一个独立插件，不改动 better-sidebar 源码。"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## 功能"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"- 🗂️ 拖拽**任意文件**（文本 / 图片 / PDF / 二进制…）上传，上传到指定目录\n- 📁 拖拽**整个文件夹**上传，按原目录结构落盘\n- 📂 文件树展示文件与文件夹；点文件在侧边栏编辑"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"器打开\n- ↕️ **拖拽移动**：把文件/文件夹拖到另一个文件夹上移动（冲突报错跳过，不覆盖）\n- ✏️ **重命名**：右键 → 重命名\n- 🗑️ **删除**：右键 → 删除（永久删除 + 二次"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"确认；文件夹递归删除）\n- ➕ **新建文件夹**：在选中目录下建子目录\n- 🔒 Host/Origin 请求检查、上传大小限制及工作目录路径检查；当前实现使用路径字符串比较，不保证符号链接或所有路径"},{"id":"p30s4","text":"*新建文件夹**：在选中目录下建子目录\n- 🔒 Host/Origin 请求检查、上传大小限制及工作目录路径检查；当前实现使用路径字符串比较，不保证符号链接或所有路径穿越场景的隔离，请用于可信工作区。"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## 安装"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"> 前置：已安装 `dsh-better-sidebar`（本插件通过其 `betterSidebar` 服务注册 tab）。"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"装完**重启 `dsh web`**（本插件含 host 半），再**浏览器硬刷新**（Cmd/Ctrl+Shift+R），侧边栏 `+` 菜单里就会出现「文件」tab。"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"## 工作原理"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"| 半边 | 作用 |"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"| host（`src/index.ts` → `lib/index.js`） | 注册 `/sidebar-explorer/*` 路由：`upload`（原始字节）/ `delete` / `mo"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"ve` / `rename` / `mkdir`（JSON），全部限定在会话 cwd 内 |\n| client（`src/client/index.tsx` → `lib/client.js`） | "},{"id":"p37s3","text":"`ctx.betterSidebar.registerTab` 注册 `sidebar-explorer` tab，渲染文件树 + 拖拽区 + 右键菜单 |"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"路由契约：`POST /sidebar-explorer/<op>`；`upload` 用 query（`sessionId`/`dir`/`name`）+ 原始 body，其余用 JSON body"},{"id":"p38s2","text":"（`sessionId`/`path`/`from`/`to`/`name`），均可携带可选 `cwd`。成功响应为 `{ ok: true, value }`，操作错误为 `{ ok: false,"},{"id":"p38s3","text":" error: { code, message } }`；请求信任检查失败或 HTTP 方法不支持时直接返回 403/405。"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
